A definition or attribute line in a nested container leaves no paragraph for an unmarked line

```
- a
  - para
    [r]: /u
x
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <ul>
      <li>para</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>x</p>
```

```
- a
  - para
    {#x}
x
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <ul>
      <li>para</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>x</p>
```

```
- a[^f]
  - para
    [^f]: n
      more
x
.
<ul>
  <li>a<a id="fnref1" href="#fn1" role="doc-noteref"><sup>1</sup></a>
    <ul>
      <li>para</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>x</p>
<section role="doc-endnotes" aria-label="Footnotes">
  <hr>
  <ol>
    <li id="fn1">
      <p>n
more<a href="#fnref1" role="doc-backlink" aria-label="Back to reference">↩</a></p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>
```

```
> - para
>   [^f]: n
tail
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>para</li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
<p>tail</p>
```

```
> > - para
> >   [^f]: n
tail
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote>
    <ul>
      <li>para</li>
    </ul>
  </blockquote>
</blockquote>
<p>tail</p>
```

